  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }

    :root {
      --bg1: #f7f9ff;
      --bg2: #eef2ff;
      --bg3: #f2f6ff;
      --bg4: #e8efff;
      --text: #24304f;
      --muted: #5f6999;
      --soft: #6f78a8;
      --border: rgba(79, 124, 255, 0.14);
      --blue: #4f7cff;
      --blue-dark: #3d63d6;
      --green: #16a34a;
      --green-dark: #12833b;
      --white: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      --soft-card: #f6f8ff;
      --shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(25,35,90,0.10);
      --shadow-soft: 0 14px 28px rgba(79,124,255,.12);
      --radius-xl: 26px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--bg1), var(--bg2), var(--bg3), var(--bg4));
      background-size: 400% 400%;
      animation: bgMove 12s ease infinite;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    @keyframes bgMove {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50% }
      50% { background-position: 100% 50% }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50% }
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--white);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 36px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(25,35,90,0.15);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #edf3ff;
      color: var(--blue-dark);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .brand {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--blue-dark);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 2.85rem;
      line-height: 1.08;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: #212b4a;
    }

    .headline {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 860px;
    }

    .ctaRow {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 54px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .btnPrimary {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btnPrimary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(79,124,255,.30);
      background: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    .btnWhats {
      background: var(--green);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btnWhats:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(22,163,74,.28);
      background: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .btnSoft {
      background: var(--soft-card);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .btnSoft:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: #eef3ff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding-top: 26px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .sectionTitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #253253;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .sectionSub {
      color: var(--soft);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .areaCard {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: var(--soft-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      color: var(--text);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      min-height: 112px;
    }

    .areaCard:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: #eef3ff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .areaCard h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #2a3560;
    }

    .areaCard p {
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .pillGrid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .pillLink {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 54px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--soft-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #2b2f55;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .pillLink:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: #eef3ff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .infoBox {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8faff 0%, #f3f6ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .infoBox strong {
      color: #28345b;
    }

    .miniGrid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .miniCard {
      background: #f8faff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .miniCard h3 {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #2b3560;
    }

    .miniCard p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .footerCta {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #8a93c8;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .floating-whatsapp {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 22px;
      right: 22px;
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      background: #25D366;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      z-index: 999;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      animation: whatsappPulse 2.2s infinite;
    }

    .floating-whatsapp:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.08);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      animation: none;
    }

    .floating-whatsapp::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
      z-index: -1;
      animation: whatsappRing 2.2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes whatsappPulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.06); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    @keyframes whatsappRing {
      0% {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 0.6;
      }
      70% {
        transform: scale(1.8);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .card {
        padding: 28px 18px 34px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.15rem;
      }

      .headline {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .miniGrid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .floating-whatsapp {
        width: 54px;
        height: 54px;
        bottom: 18px;
        right: 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="wrap">
    <main class="card">

      <div class="hero">
        <img src="/banner.jpg" alt="Hani Properties listings across Selangor and Klang Valley">
      </div>

      <div class="eyebrow">Rental • Sale • Projects</div>
      <div class="brand">Hani Properties</div>

      <h1>Sewa Rumah Selangor &amp; Klang Valley</h1>

      <p class="headline">
        Cari apartment, condo dan rumah untuk disewa ikut kawasan, bajet dan jenis unit. Browse pilihan di Shah Alam, Puchong, Petaling Jaya, Cyberjaya dan kawasan lain dengan Hani Properties.
      </p>

      <div class="ctaRow">
        <a class="btn btnWhats"
          href="https://wa.me/60125459182?text=Hi%20Hani%2C%20saya%20nak%20cari%20unit%20untuk%20disewa."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">
          WhatsApp Hani
        </a>

        <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/rental/selangor/index.html">
          Browse Rental Areas
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">Kawasan Sewa Popular</div>
        <div class="sectionSub">
          Antara kawasan paling kerap dicari untuk sewa rumah, condo dan apartment di Selangor dan Klang Valley.
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <a class="areaCard" href="/rental/selangor/shah-alam.html">
            <h3>Shah Alam</h3>
            <p>Popular untuk family, working adult dan student dengan banyak pilihan apartment dan condo.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="areaCard" href="/rental/selangor/puchong.html">
            <h3>Puchong</h3>
            <p>Kawasan matang dengan akses highway yang kuat dan banyak pilihan unit mengikut bajet.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="areaCard" href="/rental/selangor/petaling-jaya.html">
            <h3>Petaling Jaya</h3>
            <p>Lokasi strategik untuk penyewa yang bekerja di PJ atau Kuala Lumpur.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="areaCard" href="/rental/selangor/cyberjaya.html">
            <h3>Cyberjaya</h3>
            <p>High demand untuk studio, 1 bilik dan unit moden bagi working adult dan pasangan.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">Properties for Rent</div>
        <div class="sectionSub">
          Browse rental listings by state and continue into area pages untuk semak pilihan yang lebih spesifik.
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/rental/selangor/index.html">For Rent in Selangor</a>
          <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/rental/kuala/index.html">For Rent in Kuala Lumpur</a>
          <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/rental/negeri/index.html">For Rent in Negeri Sembilan</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">Properties for Sale</div>
        <div class="sectionSub">
          Browse subsale and sale listings by state.
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <a class="btn btnSoft" href="/subsale/selangor/index.html">For Sale in Selangor</a>
          <a class="btn btnSoft" href="/subsale/kuala/index.html">For Sale in Kuala Lumpur</a>
          <a class="btn btnSoft" href="/subsale/ns/index.html">For Sale in Negeri Sembilan</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">Browse by Popular Rental Areas</div>
        <div class="sectionSub">
          Masuk terus ke area page untuk tengok ringkasan kawasan, julat harga sewa dan akses ke listing semasa.
        </div>

        <div class="pillGrid">
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/shah-alam.html">Shah Alam</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/puchong.html">Puchong</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/subang-jaya.html">Subang Jaya</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/petaling-jaya.html">Petaling Jaya</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/kajang.html">Kajang</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/cyberjaya.html">Cyberjaya</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/seri-kembangan.html">Seri Kembangan</a>
          <a class="pillLink" href="/rental/selangor/klang.html">Klang</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">Sewa Rumah di Selangor</div>

        <div class="infoBox">
          Selangor merupakan antara kawasan paling aktif untuk sewaan di Malaysia dengan pelbagai pilihan <strong>apartment</strong>, <strong>condo</strong> dan <strong>rumah untuk disewa</strong>. Kawasan seperti <strong>Shah Alam</strong> dan <strong>Puchong</strong> biasanya sesuai untuk family, manakala <strong>Cyberjaya</strong> dan <strong>Petaling Jaya</strong> sering menjadi pilihan working adult. Julat harga sewa boleh berbeza mengikut lokasi, jenis unit, saiz dan furnishing.
        </div>

        <div class="miniGrid">
          <div class="miniCard">
            <h3>Untuk Working Adult</h3>
            <p>Biasanya cari kawasan dengan akses highway, MRT atau lokasi kerja yang dekat seperti PJ, Cyberjaya dan Subang.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="miniCard">
            <h3>Untuk Pasangan &amp; Family</h3>
            <p>Selalunya fokus pada unit 2 hingga 3 bilik di Shah Alam, Puchong, Kajang atau Seri Kembangan.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="miniCard">
            <h3>Untuk Cari Unit Cepat</h3>
            <p>Pilih kawasan dulu, semak area page, kemudian terus enquire melalui WhatsApp untuk shortlist unit yang sesuai.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footerCta">
          <a class="btn btnWhats"
            href="https://wa.me/60125459182?text=Hi%20Hani%2C%20boleh%20bantu%20saya%20cari%20unit%20yang%20sesuai%3F"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener">
            Tak jumpa unit yang sesuai? WhatsApp Hani
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sectionTitle">More from Hani Properties</div>
        <div class="sectionSub">
          Explore projects, results and additional services.
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <a class="btn btnSoft"
            href="https://haniproperties.notion.site/Latest-Projects-31dff4d844bb80c0892dd7c78ff37374?source=copy_link"
            target="_blank"
